# Five ink-outlined circles (r 6) slide left to right over 1s in an 8-frame strip. Rows top to bottom use ease:
# linear (red), in (blue), out (green), in_out (gold), hold (ink). Each row starts at x=12 in frame 1.
# Per-frame steps: linear red moves the same distance each frame; in blue moves little at first and most in the last frames;
# out green moves most in the first frames and little at the end; in_out gold is slow at both ends and fastest mid-strip;
# hold ink stays at x=12 in every frame (it never leaves the left edge). The five rows keep y 12, 30, 48, 66, 84.
@artboard 96x96
@target anim/key_ease.gif fps:8 dur:1s

circle 6 at:key(12 84 ease:linear dur:1s),12 fill:p.red stroke:p.ink,1
circle 6 at:key(12 84 ease:in dur:1s),30 fill:p.blue stroke:p.ink,1
circle 6 at:key(12 84 ease:out dur:1s),48 fill:p.green stroke:p.ink,1
circle 6 at:key(12 84 ease:in_out dur:1s),66 fill:p.gold stroke:p.ink,1
circle 6 at:key(12 84 ease:hold dur:1s),84 fill:p.ink stroke:p.ink,1
